OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMaddy Cusack 'more than a number on a
OL,4,Ashirt' as anniversary falls during
OL,5,Ainquest delay
OL,6,
OL,7,FSitting on a bench dedicated to her
OL,8,Fmemory, Maddy Cusack's sister and
OL,9,Fcousin fondly remember her as their
OL,10,Fsunshine and someone with a real sense
OL,11,Fof fun.
OL,13,FOlivia Cusack says her big sister was
OL,14,Fthe person "I looked up to my whole
OL,15,Flife", while for Emily Reilly, her
OL,16,Fcousin Maddy's the one who "used to get
OL,17,Fus in trouble with my dad".
OL,19,FBut as they come to remember the former
OL,20,FSheffield United footballer on the
OL,21,Fthird anniversary of her death, they're
OL,22,Fstill waiting for answers.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
